* 07-bjt-pair.lib - matched NPN pair with emitter degeneration
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.model NPN_PAIR_Q NPN(IS=10f BF=200 VAF=100 CJE=2p CJC=1.5p TF=400p)
.model NPN_UNUSED NPN(IS=1f BF=50)
*
.subckt NPN_PAIR C1 B1 C2 B2 E
Q1 C1 B1 E1 NPN_PAIR_Q
Q2 C2 B2 E2 NPN_PAIR_Q
RE1 E1 E 10
RE2 E2 E 10
.ends
